      "title": "婚前间入宫，钟后怜爱",
      "summary": "原书记她年少以后族身份不时入宫、钟后怜爱；昭惠病中所见与她待年，按各书叙法保存，不作确定病因。",
      "year": null,
      "sortOrder": 1,
      "precision": "undated",
      "sourceDate": "婚礼以前；未独记年月或她的年龄",
      "phase": "uncertain",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "chapterId": "shiguochunqiu-v018",
          "paragraphId": "shiguochunqiu-v018-p9",
          "originalRevision": 1,
          "originalSha256": "ad8887d2d1b3ca9a41d53b113875625fae38d2dc8e18f7f56e3aba702cc1aaa0",
          "excerpt": "后少以戚里，間入宮掖，聖尊后絕憐愛之。"
        },
        {
          "chapterId": "nantangma-v006",
          "paragraphId": "nantangma-v006-p9",
          "originalRevision": 1,
          "originalSha256": "82b039bce5c27658fda87123e2654d072ad3e5f3a48c623f87707673f851114f",
          "excerpt": "昭惠感疾后常出入卧内而昭惠未之知也"
        }
      ],
      "notes": [
        "原书只记钟后怜爱，未记召入、命婚或册立。"
      ]
    },
